activity CompareDecisionConfidenceEvidenceLedgerCandidateReviewMetric(DecisionConfidenceEvidenceLedgerCandidateReviewMetric, DecisionConfidenceEvidenceLedgerCandidateReviewMetric) -> DecisionConfidenceEvidenceLedgerCandidateReviewMetricComparison
